==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] (1,000%) spawn, delay 50~60 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crab]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] (1,000%) spawn, delay 25~30 seconds<sup>750f~900f</sup>.
**6 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] (1,000%) spawn, delay 8.33~11.67 seconds<sup>250f~350f</sup>.
**9 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] (1,000%) spawn, delay 5~8.33 seconds<sup>150f~250f</sup>.
**13 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] (1,000%) spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. On higher level difficulties though, you'll need some good [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Units]] to deal with the swarm of Crabs.

